{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12779","headline":"赠别崔司直赴江东兼简常州独孤使君 · 韩翃","name":"赠别崔司直赴江东兼简常州独孤使君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"爱君青袍色，芳草能相似。\n官重法家流，名高墨曹吏。\n春衣淮上宿，美酒江边醉。\n楚酪沃雕胡，湘羹糁香饵。\n前朝山水国，旧日风流地。\n苏山逐青骢，江家驱白鼻。\n右军尚少年，三领东方骑。\n亦过小丹阳，应知百城贵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩翃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12779.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12779","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}